    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advance to the next floor. <br>Identify the anomaly. <br>Make your choice.</h2><br>You attempt to use the elevator, yet you're met with an eerily familiar hallway each time: identical cardboard boxes, the same woman smoking in her bathrobe, the same unchanging view.<br><br>But is it truly identical? The challenge is to recognize the anomaly, the subtle and sometimes not-so-subtle difference that will allow you to move to the next level. <br><br>Is the coast clear? Press 0 in the elevator to proceed. Notice an anomaly? Something extraordinary or surreal? Stay composed and press B to peel back a layer of reality.<br><br>Strive to reach level 0 to escape and achieve freedom in this compact immersive first-person puzzle game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time </h2>15 - 60 Minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 30 unique events after the elevator doors open.<br></li><li> A catchy elevator tune you won't forget.<br></li><li> Hidden endings that are tough to find.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Advance to the next floor. <br>Identify the anomaly. <br>Make your choice.</h2><br>You attempt to use the elevator, yet you're met with an eerily familiar hallway each time: identical cardboard boxes, the same woman smoking in her bathrobe, the same unchanging view.<br><br>But is it truly identical? The challenge is to recognize the anomaly, the subtle and sometimes not-so-subtle difference that will allow you to move to the next level. <br><br>Is the coast clear? Press 0 in the elevator to proceed. Notice an anomaly? Something extraordinary or surreal? Stay composed and press B to peel back a layer of reality.<br><br>Strive to reach level 0 to escape and achieve freedom in this compact immersive first-person puzzle game.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Time </h2>15 - 60 Minutes<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Over 30 unique events after the elevator doors open.<br></li><li> A catchy elevator tune you won't forget.<br></li><li> Hidden endings that are tough to find.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "In Elevator Zero, a first-person exploration and puzzle game, you find yourself trapped in an otherworldly dimension. Escape is possible only through the elevator.",
